WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.415
Particle i, between two neighbours.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.516
Twenty six weighted surface points.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:06.180
Sample the flow at each.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:08.899
The arrows gather tail to tail.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.026
They merge into one weighted average, W sub i.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:18.201
Single points vary widely. Even the centre misses the exact average slightly.
